# The GitHub Actions configs keep their own consistent 4-space
# convention; letting prettier reflow them churns every cross-PR merge
# on workflow files (this repo edits ci.yml frequently). actionlint and
# shellcheck still scan these paths — only prettier is turned off here
# (qlty triage does not apply to formatter runs, so the ignore file is
# the mechanism prettier itself honors).
.github/**

# tauri/gen/** is owned by the tauri CLI: `cargo tauri ios ...` rewrites
# the Xcode/Android project files in generator style. If prettier is the
# last writer, the next regeneration dirties the tree and puts format-only
# churn into the delta of the first PR that touches iOS configuration.
# The committed bytes match generator output — exclude the whole tree.
tauri/gen/**
